          </a>
          <a
            class="podcast__social-link"
            href="https://www.tiktok.com/@letstalkaboutthatpod"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="TikTok"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 0h1.98c.144.715.54 1.617 1.235 2.512C12.895 3.389 13.797 4 15 4v2c-1.753 0-3.07-.814-4-1.829V11a5 5 0 1 1-5-5v2a3 3 0 1 0 3 3z"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a
            class="podcast__social-link"
            href="https://www.youtube.com/@letstalkaboutthatpod"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="YouTube"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8.051 1.999h.089c.822.003 4.987.033 6.11.335a2.01 2.01 0 0 1 1.415 1.42c.101.38.172.883.22 1.402l.01.104.022.26.008.104c.065.914.073 1.77.074 1.957v.075c-.001.194-.01 1.108-.082 2.06l-.008.105-.009.104c-.05.572-.124 1.14-.235 1.558a2.01 2.01 0 0 1-1.415 1.42c-1.16.312-5.569.334-6.18.335h-.142c-.309 0-1.587-.006-2.927-.052l-.17-.006-.087-.004-.171-.007-.171-.007c-1.11-.049-2.167-.128-2.654-.26a2.01 2.01 0 0 1-1.415-1.419c-.111-.417-.185-.986-.235-1.558L.09 9.82l-.008-.104A31 31 0 0 1 0 7.68v-.123c.002-.215.01-.958.064-1.778l.007-.103.003-.052.008-.104.022-.26.01-.104c.048-.519.119-1.023.22-1.402a2.01 2.01 0 0 1 1.415-1.42c.487-.13 1.544-.21 2.654-.26l.17-.007.172-.006.086-.003.171-.007A100 100 0 0 1 7.858 2zM6.4 5.209v4.818l4.157-2.408z"/></svg>
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div class="podcast__copy">
          <p>Are you ready to talk about THAT??? Each week, power-couple Larry Saperstein and Jacob Bellotti unpack pop culture, talk to their celebrity friends, and keep you updated on the most important topics in the world!</p>
          <p>This queer-focused comedy podcast airs every Monday and streams on every major platform, including Spotify, Apple Music, Amazon, YouTube, iHeart Radio, and more.</p>
          <p>The podcast has been well-received, leading to multiple partnerships with GLAAD and a dedicated fan base who tune in every week. With insider industry talk, Let’s Talk About That! has taken the world by storm.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="site-section" id="contact" aria-label="Contact">
      <section class="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <h1 class="contact__title" id="contact-title">Contact</h1>
        <p class="contact__intro">Thanks for getting in touch! Please fill out this contact form and I'll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>

        <form class="contact-form" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="c62ea38a-d4af-4d42-9de5-fd75939b5c61">
          <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New Contact Form Submission — Jacob Bellotti">
          <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Jacob Bellotti Website">
          <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="contact-form__honeypot" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">

          <div class="contact-form__fields">
            <div class="contact-form__group">
              <label for="name" class="contact-form__label">Name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" class="contact-form__input" placeholder="Your name" type="text" required>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-form__group">
              <label for="email" class="contact-form__label">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" class="contact-form__input" placeholder="Your email" type="email" required>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-form__group">
              <label for="phone" class="contact-form__label">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" class="contact-form__input" placeholder="+1 (234) 567-8900" type="tel">
            </div>
            <div class="contact-form__group">
              <label for="message" class="contact-form__label">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" class="contact-form__textarea" placeholder="Your message" required></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button class="contact-form__submit" type="submit">Send Message</button>
        </form>
      </section>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer" aria-label="Site footer">
      <nav class="site-footer__sitemap" aria-label="Sitemap">
        <a class="site-footer__link" href="#home">Home</a>
        <a class="site-footer__link" href="#about">About</a>
        <a class="site-footer__link" href="#work">Work</a>
        <a class="site-footer__link" href="#design">Design</a>
        <a class="site-footer__link" href="#voiceover">Voiceover</a>
        <a class="site-footer__link" href="#podcast">Podcast</a>
        <a class="site-footer__link" href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <p class="site-footer__legal">
        © 2026 Jacob Bellotti. All rights reserved. Website by
        <a href="https://sapersteindesign.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Saperstein Creative</a>.
      </p>
    </footer>
</BaseLayout>
